       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PSCALE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 BIG    PIC 99PPP VALUE 12000.
       01 SMALL  PIC PPP99 VALUE .00045.
       01 SBIG   PIC S9(3)PP VALUE -12300.
       01 VSMALL PIC VPP9 VALUE .009.
       01 PBIN   PIC 9(3)PP COMP VALUE 45600.
       01 PPACK  PIC S9PP COMP-3 VALUE -300.
       01 N      PIC 9(7)V9(6).
       01 X      PIC X(8).
       01 E      PIC Z(6)9.99.
       01 SSMALL PIC SPPP99 VALUE -.00012.
       01 SEPP   PIC S99PP SIGN LEADING SEPARATE VALUE 4500.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY BIG " " SMALL " " SBIG " " VSMALL " " PBIN " " PPACK.
           MOVE BIG TO N. DISPLAY N.
           MOVE SMALL TO N. DISPLAY N.
           MOVE SBIG TO N. DISPLAY N.
           MOVE 98765 TO BIG. DISPLAY BIG.
           MOVE BIG TO N. DISPLAY N.
           MOVE .0012345 TO SMALL. DISPLAY SMALL.
           MOVE SMALL TO N. DISPLAY N.
           ADD 1000 TO BIG. DISPLAY BIG.
           ADD 999 TO BIG. DISPLAY BIG.
           COMPUTE BIG = BIG * 2. DISPLAY BIG.
           IF BIG = 198000 DISPLAY "eq".
           IF BIG > 197999 DISPLAY "gt".
           MOVE BIG TO X. DISPLAY "[" X "]".
           MOVE BIG TO E. DISPLAY "[" E "]".
           MOVE PBIN TO N. DISPLAY N.
           MOVE PPACK TO N. DISPLAY N.
           ADD 100 TO PPACK. DISPLAY PPACK.
           MOVE "1234" TO X.
           MOVE 7 TO VSMALL. DISPLAY VSMALL.
           MOVE .0087 TO VSMALL. DISPLAY VSMALL.
           DISPLAY SSMALL " " SEPP.
           MOVE 1234 TO SEPP. DISPLAY SEPP.
           COMPUTE SSMALL = SSMALL * 2. DISPLAY SSMALL.
           DIVIDE BIG BY 7 GIVING SMALL ROUNDED. DISPLAY SMALL.
           STOP RUN.
